WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.974
When you edit one helper,

2
00:00:01.974 --> 00:00:06.320
you can use the project’s imports
to find a test worth running first.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.074
This change touches the greeting helper.

4
00:00:10.074 --> 00:00:14.753
Slash affected follows the imports
back to the test that exercises it.

5
00:00:14.753 --> 00:00:17.560
It gives you a command for that selection.

6
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.180
Run the suggested command
to check the change.

7
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:32.500
If the graph is incomplete, Affected
will point you to a wider check.
